Dialogue: 1,0:01:41.50,0:01:42.83,Dial-CHI,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur0.7}{\3c&1A1A1A\4c&1A1A1A}您能給什麼報酬
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.50,0:01:42.83,Dial-JPN,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur0.7}{\3c&1A1A1A\4c&1A1A1A}報酬は
Dialogue: 1,0:01:44.08,0:01:48.00,Dial-CHI,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur0.7\3c&0D0D0D\4c&0D0D0D}「撓背後癢處的魔法」
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.08,0:01:48.00,Dial-JPN,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur0.7\3c&0D0D0D\4c&0D0D0D}「背中の痒い部分を掻く魔法」じゃ
Dialogue: 1,0:01:59.68,0:02:01.48,Dial-CHI,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur0.7}{\3c&333333\4c&333333}又是這種擦雕像的委託
