Dialogue: 1,0:02:06.31,0:02:10.28,Dial-CHI,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur0.7\3c&1A1A1A\4c&1A1A1A}還行 這種瑣碎的事也挺輕鬆的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.31,0:02:10.28,Dial-JPN,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur0.7\3c&1A1A1A\4c&1A1A1A}まあ こういうこまごました仕事も楽しいんだけどな
Dialogue: 1,0:02:10.69,0:02:13.24,Dial-CHI,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur0.7\3c&1A1A1A\4c&1A1A1A}好 開始擦吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.69,0:02:13.24,Dial-JPN,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur0.7\3c&1A1A1A\4c&1A1A1A}よーし　磨くぞ
Dialogue: 1,0:02:13.24,0:02:15.70,Dial-CHI,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur0.7\3c&1A1A1A\4c&1A1A1A}銅像用魔法就可以搞定了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.24,0:02:15.70,Dial-JPN,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur0.7\3c&1A1A1A\4c&1A1A1A}銅像なら魔法で磨くから
Dialogue: 1,0:02:15.70,0:02:16.12,Dial-CHI,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur0.7\3c&1A1A1A\4c&1A1A1A}還是不用你動手
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.70,0:02:16.12,Dial-JPN,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur0.7\3c&1A1A1A\4c&1A1A1A}シュタルクの出番はないけどね
Dialogue: 1,0:02:16.12,0:02:17.95,Dial-CHI,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur0.7}{\3c&333333\4c&333333}還是不用你動手
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.12,0:02:17.95,Dial-JPN,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur0.7}{\3c&333333\4c&333333}シュタルクの出番はないけどね
Dialogue: 1,0:02:26.29,0:02:28.88,Dial-CHI,,0,0,0,,{\fad(190,0)}{\bord2\blur0.7}{\3c&1a1a1a\4c&1a1a1a}不是 這大叔是誰啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.29,0:02:28.88,Dial-JPN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(190,0)}{\bord2\blur0.7}{\3c&1a1a1a\4c&1a1a1a}って誰　このおっさん
Dialogue: 1,0:02:29.59,0:02:31.63,Dial-CHI,,0,0,0,,{\c&F8F8F8\bord2\blur0.7\3c&333333\4c&333333}你們兩個還是第一次見到吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.59,0:02:31.63,Dial-JPN,,0,0,0,,{\c&F8F8F8\bord2\blur0.7\3c&333333\4c&333333}２人は初めて見るのか
Dialogue: 1,0:02:32.55,0:02:34.13,Dial-CHI,,0,0,0,,{\bord1.6\blur0.7}{\3c&1A1A1A\4c&1A1A1A}他是南方勇者
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.55,0:02:34.13,Dial-JPN,,0,0,0,,{\bord1.6\blur0.7}{\3c&1A1A1A\4c&1A1A1A}南の勇者だよ
Dialogue: 1,0:02:35.89,0:02:38.89,Dial-CHI,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\blur0.7\3c&666666\4c&666666}擊敗魔王的的確是欣梅爾
