Dialogue: 1,0:02:39.35,0:02:40.89,Dial-CHI,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\blur0.7\3c&666666\4c&666666}可勇者不止一個
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.35,0:02:40.89,Dial-JPN,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\blur0.7\3c&666666\4c&666666}勇者は１人じゃない
Dialogue: 1,0:02:42.06,0:02:45.65,Dial-CHI,,0,0,0,,{\bord1\blur0.7\3c&666666\4c&666666}曾經 有許多勇者試圖戰勝魔王
