Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.88,0:03:11.88,Ruby,,413,0,0,,{\c&BA9F8C}{\bord1.5\blur0.7\3c&000000\4c&000000}我 們
Dialogue: 1,0:03:11.88,0:03:15.26,Dial-CHI,,0,0,0,,{\c&BA9F8C}{\bord1.5\blur0.7\3c&000000\4c&000000}只打倒了七崩賢中的兩人
