Dialogue: 1,0:03:21.35,0:03:24.10,Dial-CHI,,0,0,0,,{\c&F6F6F6}{\bord2\blur0.7\3c&1A1A1A\4c&1A1A1A}斷頭台阿烏拉就是其中之一吧
