Dialogue: 1,0:06:04.22,0:06:06.30,Dial-CHI,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur0.7\3c&000000\4c&000000}妳好像不相信
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.22,0:06:06.30,Dial-JPN,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur0.7\3c&000000\4c&000000}信じていないようだな
Dialogue: 1,0:06:07.68,0:06:09.85,Dial-CHI,,0,0,0,,{\bord2\blur0.7\3c&000000\4c&000000}不是不信
